%% Reactor render loop. State change → component re-render → element
%% record tree → reconciler diff → element pool reuse → WinUI control
%% tree → composition → frame. Default Mermaid palette is legible on
%% both light and dark GitHub themes.
flowchart LR
    State["State / hook setter<br/>UseState · UseReducer · UseObservable"]
    Component["Component.Render()<br/>RenderContext.BeginRender resets _hookIndex"]
    Elements["Element record tree<br/>immutable, no WinUI yet"]
    Reconciler["Reconciler.Reconcile()<br/>Mount · Update · Unmount"]
    ChildDiff["ChildReconciler<br/>keyed (LIS) · positional"]
    Pool["ElementPool<br/>TryRent · Return"]
    WinUI["WinUI control tree<br/>Panel.Children · ItemsRepeater · TabView"]
    Effects["RenderContext.FlushEffects<br/>cleanup → effect, in slot order"]
    Comp["Composition layer<br/>implicit / explicit animations"]
    Frame["Frame to screen"]

    State -->|setter equality check<br/>EqualityComparer.Default| Component
    Component -->|describe UI| Elements
    Elements -->|old vs new| Reconciler
    Reconciler -->|children| ChildDiff
    Reconciler -->|rent reused control| Pool
    Pool --> WinUI
    Reconciler -->|property writes| WinUI
    WinUI -->|patched tree| Effects
    Effects --> Comp
    Comp --> Frame
